title: "How complete was the audit? Estimating what red teams, auditors and interpretability tools miss"
authors:
  - family-names: Cheethirala
    given-names: Santosh
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/santoshcheethiralame-dot/Capture-Recapture"
keywords:
  - AI safety
  - alignment auditing
  - red teaming
  - interpretability
  - sparse autoencoders
  - capture-recapture
